<div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">ADMIN CONTROL CENTER · FR-01 / FR-09</span><h1>Monitoring InProsper</h1><p>Kelola verifikasi mitra serta pantau ringkasan aktivitas food rescue.</p></div><div class="metrics-grid"><div class="metric-card"><span>Merchant terverifikasi</span><strong><?= (int)$verified ?></strong><small>Akun yang dapat berjualan</small></div><div class="metric-card"><span>Transaksi berhasil</span><strong><?= (int)$successful_orders ?></strong><small>Pesanan dibayar, diproses, atau selesai</small></div><div class="metric-card"><span>Estimasi makanan terselamatkan</span><strong><?= (int)$rescued ?> <small>porsi</small></strong><small>Total item dari transaksi berhasil</small></div><div class="metric-card"><span>Nilai transaksi berhasil</span><strong><?= money($gross) ?></strong><small>Komisi dihitung 15%</small></div></div><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Antrean verifikasi merchant</h2><p class="muted">Periksa berkas usaha sebelum mengaktifkan hak berjualan.</p></div><span class="count-pill"><?= count($pending) ?> menunggu</span></div><?php if(!$pending): ?><div class="panel empty-line">Tidak ada pengajuan menunggu verifikasi.</div><?php else: ?><div class="verification-list"><?php foreach($pending as $m): ?><article class="panel verification-card"><div class="verification-top"><div class="avatar"><?= e(strtoupper(substr($m['business_name'],0,1))) ?></div><div class="verification-ident"><h3><?= e($m['business_name']) ?></h3><p><?= e($m['name']) ?> · <?= e($m['email']) ?></p><span class="muted small"><?= e($m['business_category']??'Lainnya') ?> · Diajukan <?= e(date('d M Y',strtotime($m['created_at']))) ?></span></div><span class="status status-menunggu">Menunggu</span></div><p class="small"><strong>Alamat:</strong> <?= e($m['business_address']) ?></p><?php if($m['document_url']): ?><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="<?= e($m['document_url']) ?>" class="doc-link">Lihat dokumen pengajuan ↗</a><?php else: ?><p class="muted small">Dokumen tidak tersedia.</p><?php endif; ?><div class="review-actions"><form method="post" class="inline"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="review_merchant"><input type="hidden" name="merchant_id" value="<?= (int)$m['merchant_id'] ?>"><input type="hidden" name="decision" value="approve"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-small">Setujui merchant</button></form><form method="post" class="reject-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="review_merchant"><input type="hidden" name="merchant_id" value="<?= (int)$m['merchant_id'] ?>"><input type="hidden" name="decision" value="reject"><input name="reason" required placeholder="Alasan penolakan"><button class="btn btn-outline btn-small">Tolak</button></form></div></article><?php endforeach; ?></div><?php endif; ?></section><p class="tiny muted">Catatan: metrik porsi adalah estimasi berdasarkan jumlah item transaksi yang berhasil dan tidak dibatalkan, bukan pengukuran berat makanan.</p>
